@startuml moderation-layers
' Intended hexagonal packages inside Moderation (Kotlin).
' Picture only. Bytecode currently has domain → application
' (ModerationResult / ClassificationResult) and application →
' infrastructure (HTTP DTOs, ProviderException). ArchUnit would fail.
' Do not pass this file to adhereToPlantUmlDiagram.

title Moderation layers (documentation)
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

[domain]
[application]
[infrastructure]
[config]

application --> domain
infrastructure --> application
infrastructure --> domain
config --> application
config --> domain
config --> infrastructure

note bottom
  Intended arrows. Not an ArchUnit input until
  domain stops importing application commands
  and application stops importing infrastructure.
end note

@enduml
